# Keep the build context small: everything below is produced by a build, not an input to one. The
# two exceptions are the point of the context now that the Dockerfiles only package a binary
# somebody else built (deploy/Dockerfile.hub) -- they come after the rule that would exclude them,
# because the last pattern to match a path wins.
target/
*/target/
!hub/target/jailhub
!node/target/jailscale
.git/
docs/
*.md
